Care Med</source><year>2000</year><volume>26</volume><fpage>1584</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11126281</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s001340000659</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mohammedi</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Ploin</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Duperret</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Chapuis</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Petit</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Risk factors for piperacillin/tazobactam-resistant <italic>Escherichia coli </italic>in ICU patients: a clinical study</article-title><source>Intensive Care Med</source><year>2003</year><volume>29</volume><fpage>1164</fpage><lpage>1168</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12774156</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s00134-003-1760-9</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Vergis</surname><given-names>EN</given-names></name><name><surname>Hayden</surname><given-names>MK</given-names></name><name><surname>Chow</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></name><name><surname>Snydman</surname><given-names>DR</given-names></name><name><surname>Zervos</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Linden</surname><given-names>PK</given-names></name><name><surname>Wagener</surname><given-names>MM</given-names></name><name><surname>Schmitt</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Muder</surname><given-names>RR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Determinants of vancomycin resistance and mortality rates in enterococcal bacteremia: a prospective multicenter study</article-title><source>Ann Intern Med</source><year>2001</year><volume>135</volume><fpage>484</fpage><lpage>492</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11578151</p